+ * default: 1280x800 at scale 1; portrait: 430x660 at scale 2) and casts JPEGs of that size in
+ * device px whose metadata stays in CSS px; tab ids are the browser's own; the Bot keeps the tab a
+ * person picked (headless too) and moves to a neighbour or the newest when it closes; history and
+ * Chromium's error page read as the app's bar needs; a tab opened for a person has the headless
+ * user agent fix before anything loads in it.
